<title>POLAND: SWARZEDZ TURNS TO LOSS IN APRIL.</title>
<headline>SWARZEDZ TURNS TO LOSS IN APRIL.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results April</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> APRIL		    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net loss		 1.10 vs   0.03 profit</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   1.10 vs   0.10 profit</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.25 vs   1.41</p>
<p> Sales		   11.07 vs   8.85</p>
<p> JANUARY-APRIL	  1997     1996</p>
<p> Net loss		 0.60 vs   0.16 profit</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   0.60 vs   0.33 profit</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.96 vs   4.74</p>
<p> Sales		   40.80 vs  35.25</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish furniture maker is Swarzedzkie</p>
<p>Farbryki Mebli SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
